tolome-locales (0.1.0) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Initial packaging: locale fr_BJ (French, Benin), compiled with
    localedef --no-archive into /usr/lib/locale.
  * /usr/share/i18n/SUPPORTED is diverted and regenerated by a trigger so
    that Calamares lists the new locales.
  * Structure ready for fon_BJ (one definition file and one manifest line).

